# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file
version: v1.25.0
ignore:
  SNYK-JS-FFLATE-22392372:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          Not reachable. The only fflate import in @shuding/opentype.js (via satori) is inflateSync, used for
          WOFF font decompression; the vulnerable unzipSync is never called. renderImage.ts loads a single
          bundled TTF, so no user-supplied archives or fonts are processed. No fixed fflate release exists;
          re-evaluate on expiry.
        expires: 2027-02-09T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-11-11T00:00:00.000Z
patch: {}
